- Wave propagation for use with photovoltaic cells;
- Wave propagation for use with solar cells;
- Energy storage and distribution;
- Power generation from the sun;
- Solar power in buildings;
- Applications of the wind turbine;
- Generation of electricity from the ocean;
- Winds and waves;
- Water waves;
- Waves in liquids and gases;
